<title>USA: St Joseph hogs $1.50 higher - USDA.</title>
<headline>St Joseph hogs $1.50 higher - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>ST JOSEPH 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $1.50</p>
<p>higher. Top $58.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3	230-270 lbs    57.50-58.00</p>
<p>US 2-3	270-290 lbs    56.00-57.00</p>
<p>US 1-2	290-310 lbs    54.00-55.00</p>
<p>Sows:  Under 550 lbs steady to 0.50 higher; over 550 lbs steady</p>
<p>to1.00 higher. Top 50.00.</p>
<p>US 1-2	300-500 lbs    48.00</p>
<p>		500-550 lbs    48.50</p>
<p>US 1-3	550-700 lbs    49.00-50.00</p>
</text>
